	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "DIN 41524 5-pin socket, 180 degrees, PCB mount (ОНЦ-КГ-4-5/16-Р, XS2 of НС4): the holes as the rev. 3А board has them - pins 1, 2, 3 in a row 10 mm in from the mounting legs, 4 and 5 2.5 mm behind, all on a 2.5 mm grid (3.858.420 СБ sheet 2, «Установка XS2»: 2.5 and 10 mm); the mating face toward -X, over the board edge; pins 1 and 3, 4 and 5 numbered as the 1991 copper wires Э3's XS2:1..5 (from SA1 19/20 .. 11/12), corrected 2026-11-10")
